%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2f988bc0d55107749a911c0375bba164, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dial_Momo_AcademyIntroduction
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  speakerNpcId: momo
  playerFacingPolicy: 1
  lines:
  - speakerName: Momo
    text: Easy there, newcomer. The paint is wet, the machinery bites, and I dislike
      repeating myself. I'm Momo.
    typeSpeed: 48
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f80b9c86e9c02ea4e8cfc37c541783f9, type: 3}
    portraitTint: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 0}
      targetSource: 5
      npcId: 
      targetTag: 
    choices: []
  - speakerName: Momo
    text: 'This is the Academy. We built it around an antique we found humming beneath
      the ruins: a candy machine, if you can believe the label.'
    typeSpeed: 48
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f80b9c86e9c02ea4e8cfc37c541783f9, type: 3}
    portraitTint: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 0}
      targetSource: 5
      npcId: 
      targetTag: 
    choices: []
  - speakerName: Momo
    text: It wasn't made for sweets. Not really. The old thing can read a combat
      pattern and teach that pattern to a Chainling.
    typeSpeed: 48
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f80b9c86e9c02ea4e8cfc37c541783f9, type: 3}
    portraitTint: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 0}
      targetSource: 5
      npcId: 
      targetTag: 
    choices: []
  - speakerName: Momo
    text: We apes learned how to tune the process. Put a Chainling through the system,
      and it can come away knowing a move it never knew before.
    typeSpeed: 48
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f80b9c86e9c02ea4e8cfc37c541783f9, type: 3}
    portraitTint: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 0}
      targetSource: 5
      npcId: 
      targetTag: 
    choices: []
  - speakerName: Momo
    text: Master a move deeply enough and we can stamp its pattern, bind it in ink
      and fiber, and make the knowledge physical.
    typeSpeed: 48
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f80b9c86e9c02ea4e8cfc37c541783f9, type: 3}
    portraitTint: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 0}
      targetSource: 5
      npcId: 
      targetTag: 
    choices: []
  - speakerName: Momo
    text: Books. Actual books. Each one puts a little something back on those empty
      shelves. Someday, if we don't make a mess of it, we'll restore the whole library.
    typeSpeed: 48
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f80b9c86e9c02ea4e8cfc37c541783f9, type: 3}
    portraitTint: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 0}
      targetSource: 5
      npcId: 
      targetTag: 
    choices: []
  - speakerName: Momo
    text: So learn something sharp, make it yours, and bring it back worth binding.
      Try to have a little style while you're at it.
    typeSpeed: 48
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f80b9c86e9c02ea4e8cfc37c541783f9, type: 3}
    portraitTint: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 0}
      targetSource: 5
      npcId: 
      targetTag: 
    choices: []
  autoAdvance: 0
  autoAdvanceDelay: 2
  allowSkip: 1
  skipToEndOfLine: 1
